      en: ["The park covers a total area of approximately 1,470 hectares.", "Aogu was officially inaugurated as a forest park in 2012.", "More than 200 different bird species have been recorded in the area.", "The rare Black-faced Spoonbill regularly winters here.", "The land was originally reclaimed from the sea during the 1960s.", "It is the largest wetland in Taiwan created by soil subsidence."],
